    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Palantzian",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118134510048066964288/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWwYOnhCSBurInMeU7bKfmjeQaU6UOOl8oFubSG60I1S39o47K0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "The only place to have your kids vaccinated. You can feel the passion in their work. My 4 year old won't even go see a doctor or dentist. She had no issues with Geneviève, sat on the chair and got a vaccine. NOT ONE CRY! actually smiled and got a candy! Simply the best! Thank you for the wonderful experience",
        "time": 1764078616,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Darya Shamsabadi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112145364862461962086/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKuIL5fRY2Cce2495-Fu29w4E4BxFLDVu6nMev_IcALwQC6Zw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Ive come here a few times for blood tests and I always receive a friendly greeting and service. Anywhere else ive been they have a hard time finding my veins for blood tests and I end up being pricked multiple times but have never had this issue here. They are quick and efficient.",
        "time": 1764942785,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tally Krilick",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103517830772023885472/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7PjReWMen7my2IMAKOojU5UrOgD4Pl2wH7k1Ktbyxtf_Fee2f=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Absolutely the best place to get a blood test! I will never go anywhere else. I went this morning told my nurse Genevieve I wasn’t feeling well and she was so gentle and quick. Hands down the best experience I’ve ever had. Will recommend to everyone!",
        "time": 1764699919,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "adam rulli",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114156495466137672359/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX4rtaHanqGzFBVGGZMGmFbttX_DmhRfOpJvnxGHCDdEekOgpNQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "The team at Globuline are are absolutely amazing! The staff is incredibly friendly and knowledgeable. It's also the only place I go for my blood tests. This is the only place where when I do my blood test it doesn't hurt and I don't have to cry like a little baby. 100/10. I would recommend this place to anybody. If you haven't already been here, you're missing out.",
        "time": 1762526299,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Robyn Santos-Hufana",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116875800096374093898/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLlXSrg3rIcrQes47CHIpwtlAaMN-jgJ6JXMb1pGtJAX-FArg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I am an absolute scaredy-cat when it comes to this kind of thing, especially after having something of a horror show in hospitals in the past when getting my blood drawn or placing an iv. Sam was able to find my vein in one shot (which is a Halloween miracle) and was really kind and attentive. His friendly demeanor really helped me take my mind off the fact that I was getting my blood drawn.",
        "time": 1761578418,
        "translated": false
      }
